Breaks: devjam-tools (<< 1.98-1~)
Replaces: devjam-tools (<< 1.98-1~)
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: S benchmark suite for storage I/O responsiveness
 The S benchmark suite by Paolo Valente measures application start-up
 latency, throughput, fairness and video playback while the disk is under
 load, for example to compare I/O schedulers.
 .
 The suite runs from a writable directory on the disk under test, so it
 is installed as a template in /usr/share/devjam/s-benchmark;
 s-benchmark-copy copies it to a directory of choice.
